A 2025 arXiv research paper by S. Sundar. PREFACE

These notes grew out of two courses given by the author on
C^{*}
-algebras, one at IMSC, Chennai and an another at IIT, Gandhinagar. The audience were graduate students interested in pursuing research in topics such as NCG, K-theory, Quantum groups,
E_{0}
-semigroups etc…
The aim of the courses was to acquaint the students with a few basic notions in the theory of
C^{*}
-algebras which, in the author’s opinion, are
indispensable to read current papers in the above mentioned topics.
